# dp/dPsi [Pa per unit normalised flux]
#
# Converted from H_limited_circular_shaped.npz, a 257 x 257
# freegs4e free-boundary solve.
# freegs4e tabulates against NORMALISED flux; this is against psi.
# psi_axis = 9.337738633e-02, psi_surface = 2.983305030e-02,
# the psi_n = 0.95 surface, chosen to avoid the X-point corner
# and the fractional power at the plasma edge.
# freegs4e's pprime/ffprime are ALREADY d/dpsi -- its docstring
# says d/dpsi_n and is wrong -- so the value column is unchanged
# and only the derivative column carries a chain-rule factor.
#
# Three columns: Psi, value, d(value)/dPsi.
# Psi = psi/psi_ax is MEQ's NORMALISED flux: ONE on the magnetic
# axis and ZERO on Gamma, which is the opposite sense to
# freegs4e's psi_n and to EQDSK's. The value column is therefore
# d/dPsi and not d/dpsi; meq::NormalisedMHDSource divides by
# psi_ax itself, so do not pre-divide the table.
#
